# QGuard Messaging™ Secure Workspace Protection

## Objective

Implement an additional security layer that requires user authentication before access is granted to:

* Secure Chat
* Quantum Vault

Even after the user has already signed in to the QGuard Messaging application.

This creates a Zero-Trust Workspace Access model where application login and data access are separate security controls.

---

# Security Model

## Layer 1

Application Authentication

User signs in using:

* Username
* Password
* MFA (optional)

This grants access to the application shell only.

The user can:

* View dashboard
* View settings
* View telemetry
* View account information

But cannot access:

* Secure Chat
* Quantum Vault

Until additional authentication succeeds.

---

## Layer 2

Workspace Unlock

Protected modules:

* Secure Chat
* Quantum Vault

Require additional authentication.

---

